 fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-15w0zhx" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2tbsj2:"><div data-rid="b557e6d8-7844-46ac-880b-cf7f57427b48" class="r-1gzwyq2"><div data-rid="043cfedf-85af-44df-9938-deffffcb2cf2" data-list="list" class="r-16724pg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Unlike our ear seed kits, the monthly ear seed subscription doesn't include instructions or the protocol ear maps. If it's your first time using ear seeds, we recommend purchasing an Ear Seed Kit first and then signing up for the monthly subscription or buying a refill pack.</p><br><p>1. Clean & Apply – Use tweezers to place the ear seeds on key acupressure points.  </p><p><br></p><p>2. Press & Activate – Gently press on the seeds throughout the day for added stimulation.  </p><p><br></p><p>3. Wear for 3-5 Days – Replace as needed for continuous support and benefits. </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="148ad740-f4ac-4494-8eba-297c964cc4e2" class="r-1k5nwyk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2cb3b2cb-8af3-4194-be40-48c842165f7d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3tbsj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-8efd5j"><div data-rid="bff7bccc-f8ef-4cef-86c9-caaf075bb8ba" class="r-woew20 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How It Works</p></span></div><div data-rid="156c5f8a-0d07-4ec1-9d2e-729f17b4071e" class="r-jmpsip" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1v8su