rst.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c6e7e5cc-910b-4e3c-9740-9f34951b0a29" class="r-1htuxeb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a7560e06-6031-4865-b0d8-0a58c39beb29" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5ub2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1km29hw"><div data-rid="428996fc-ced3-424a-bffd-4b4e49e1fa79" class="r-lwvhok alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I pause, skip or cancel my subscription?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d7bdd4d8-9fa1-4adf-b386-fd62553a4954" class="r-1wyujag" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-zsfjrp" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5ub2:"><div data-rid="640d0711-b95a-4f33-84f5-0284ef7c1433" class="r-1w9wh64"><div data-rid="b484233a-81cc-4ec9-8e9b-9d38ed4ba328" class="r-15p9gbj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. You can pause, skip or cancel at any time through your account portal. There is no long-term commitment.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4d129602-665c-457c-9950-85d9d6189f97" class="r-kgtq4s" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e7cef49d-4234-42b9-a480-a59b4c471860" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7ub2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1ofl52h"><div data-rid="dedcec6d-a83e-4538-8110-d41721bb1829" class="r-b0ffx2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the subscription cheaper than buying multiple ear seed kits?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6695f413-e888-47da-92dd-ec6d1a6652c1" class="r-8f6hzw" aria-hidden="true"><svg str